Shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
<br />
zinda hai zinda hai fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
zinda hai zinda hai zinda hai zinda hai<br />
zinda hai zinda hai fir shauk e ibadat zinda hai<br />
shahadat shahadat, sa'adat sa'adat<br />
zinda hai zinda hai zinda hai zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
hum qatl hue har hamle par<br />
seeno me hararat sehna hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
1. Shabbir ke khatir marne par kyu duniya maare deti hai<br />
eemaan ke seene me khanjar zulmat ke utaare deti hai<br />
har gaam musibat dhati hai, har gaam hasare karti hai<br />
is gham ki feza me charo taraf nafrat bhi ubhare deti hai<br />
kya nasle umayya ke dil me abhi wo shakawat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
2. Hum farshe aza par baithe hai ye farsh hamari dharti hai<br />
shabbir ke matamdaro par duniya ye sitam kyu karti hai<br />
ye qaum to hai islam ka par qur'an hadaf ye padti hai<br />
ye fikr e husaini jurm hai kya jo isse ye duniya darti hai<br />
hum aal e nabi ke shedayi humme ye riwayat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
3. Ye qaum jo matam karti hai ye matam hai dildaro ka<br />
ye qaum jo rona karti hai ye rona hai ghumkhwaro ka<br />
kamzor na samjhe koi ise, ye lashkar hai jarraro ka<br />
jo karbobala se rishta hai wo rishta hai talwaro ka<br />
is aag ugalte maqtal me ye qaum ye millat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
4. Jin logo ke ghar ujde hai wo un khaimo ko yaad kare<br />
zakhmi jo hue hai maqtal me wo un zakhmo ko yaad kare<br />
maqtool hue jinke bacche wo un baccho ko yaad kare<br />
jin mao ke bete na rahe wo un beto ko yaad kare<br />
us gham ke tasawwur se logo mazloom ki hurmat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
5. Har saal aza ye hoti hai har saal moharram aata hai<br />
akbar ki azaan ka lehja bhi fir rasme dua ban jata hai<br />
abbas ka ye rangeen alam har gaam yuhi lehrata hai<br />
marte hai kaha ye ehle wafa fir waqt unhe dohrata hai<br />
akbar ki jawani qayam hai abbas ki seerat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
6. Jis ka ye juloos e matam hai kya uska hasham ruk jaega<br />
shabbir ke matamdaro ka badhta ye qadam ruk jaega<br />
jiski ye sabile baqi hai wo behre karam ruk jaega<br />
kya dehshat ke is maqtal me haadi ka alam ruk jaega<br />
jo noke sina par roshan hai wo tarz e qayadat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
7. Hum apni musibat me maula kab aapke ghum ko bhool gae<br />
sab ranjo sitam hai yaad hame apne pe sitam ko bhool gae<br />
talwar bhi hai zadd par lekin kab ehle haram ko bhool gae<br />
hai mashke sakina yaad hame kab deedae nam ko bhool gae<br />
is maut ke larza khezi me shabbir ki nusrat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
8. Maula ke hilaal humlogo par ye waqt bohot hi bhari hai<br />
jo maare gae un logo par ek sog hai aaho zaari hai<br />
is sog me lekin karbobala ehsaas me apne taari hai<br />
shabbir ka nauha baqi hai shabbir ka matam jaari hai<br />
safdar ki zaba par hai nauha ab taba qayamat zinda hai<br />
fir shauk e shahadat zinda hai<br />
(shabbir ki khatir jeena hai<br />
shabbir ki khatir marna hai)..(2)<br />
<br />
zinda hai zinda hai zinda hai<br />
